diff --git a/GEOSENTINEL.md b/GEOSENTINEL.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..a08d806
--- /dev/null
+++ b/GEOSENTINEL.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# GeoSentinel maintained fork
+
+Upstream: NanmiCoder/dsh-agent-teams v0.1.15
+Commit: da2e2e49242c6ecd7e801a74dba0c8268a0a2f81
+License: upstream MIT retained unchanged.
+
+The dedicated product profile enables `geosentinel: true` and `webSurface: false`.
+It enforces three specialist names, supervisor-only messaging, administrator-owned
+models, role tool allowlists, one supervisor-to-specialist level, and authenticated UI plan
+approval. Generic routes listing all workspace teams are disabled. The platform
+plugin calls `ctx.geosentinelTeams` after checking account and session ownership.
+
+Standalone upstream behavior remains the default to keep upstream regression tests
+usable. Never load the upstream default profile as the public multi-user product.
